    '如果价格隐含的增长速度高于企业实际能创造的现金流，即使收入继续增长，估值倍数下降也会压低股价。': 'If the growth implied by the price is faster than the cash flow a company can actually create, a falling valuation multiple can push the stock down even while revenue keeps growing.',
