    '中国投资者买海外科技资产时，需要同时看盈利兑现与持仓集中度；本图使用美元价格指数，尚未加入人民币汇率或分红回报。': 'Chinese investors buying overseas tech assets need to look at both earnings delivery and position concentration; this chart uses USD price indices and does not yet include the RMB exchange rate or dividend returns.',
