    '房地产损失通过杠杆、短期融资和机构之间的联系传导。救流动性可以减轻挤兑，却不等于股东损失消失。': 'Real estate losses spread through leverage, short-term funding and links between institutions. Rescuing liquidity can ease runs, but it does not make shareholder losses disappear.',
